{"content_hash": "cbd1f9ace88c9c56", "version_id": 793, "article_id": 80, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Rokid launches two AI glasses and a smart ring", "title_zh": "乐奇Rokid发布两款AI眼镜和一枚智能戒指", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8183616.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/COP30_-_Rokid_01.jpg", "provider": "openverse", "credit": "Xuthoria · by-sa 4.0 · via wikimedia", "author": "Xuthoria", "credit_url": "", "source": "Openverse", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=179047007", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(155, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(193, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f54bcf2dfbf0"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-28", "word_count": 213, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Chinese company Rokid showed three new wearable products on 27 October 2026. The lineup includes two pairs of AI glasses and a ring that lets users control them without speaking.", "lead_zh": "中国公司乐奇Rokid于2026年10月27日发布三款新穿戴产品，包括两副AI眼镜和一枚戒指，用户不用说话也能用戒指操控眼镜。", "preview": "Rokid Glasses 2 comes in black or tortoiseshell. The black model costs 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a government subsidy. The company says", "preview_zh": "Rokid Glasses 2有黑色和玳瑁色两种配色。黑色款售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元。公司称这款眼镜比第一代更小更轻，用户还可以配近视或远视镜片。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 776, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 87.5, "size_bytes": 525888, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 89.425, "size_bytes": 537552, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 95.3, "size_bytes": 572688, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 82.6, "size_bytes": 496512, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 89.0, "size_bytes": 534960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 242, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@91b304e/content/data/versions/793.json", "paragraphs": ["Rokid Glasses 2 comes in black or tortoiseshell. The black model costs 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a government subsidy. The company says the glasses are smaller and lighter than the first version, and users can add custom lenses for short-sighted or long-sighted eyes.", "The glasses have a 263mAh battery, which is 25% bigger than before. A new charging case can charge the glasses six times, and it also works with the first generation. The AI features include meeting notes, translation in 89 languages and help for deaf and blind users.", "Rokid Color is a full-colour pair of glasses that weighs 55 grams. It can show pictures, videos and maps, so users can follow directions or check tasks without looking at a phone. Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan and supports simple finger movements, plus health tracking for heart rate and sleep.", "Rokid also said its platform now has more than 45,000 registered developers and over 700 agents on its store. Partners include Xiaohongshu, Meituan and JD.com. The company announced a global developer contest with a 5 million yuan prize pool.", "However, the glasses are still expensive for many buyers. The cheapest model costs more than most smartphones in China, so Rokid must convince people that wearing a computer is worth the price."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Rokid Glasses 2有黑色和玳瑁色两种配色。黑色款售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元。公司称这款眼镜比第一代更小更轻，用户还可以配近视或远视镜片。", "这款眼镜电池容量为263mAh，比上一代大25%。新的充电盒能给眼镜充六次电，也兼容第一代产品。AI功能包括会议纪要、89种语言翻译，以及为听障和视障用户提供的辅助功能。", "Rokid Color是一副全彩眼镜，重55克。它能显示图片、视频和地图，用户不用看手机就能导航或查看任务。Rokid Ring售价1699元，支持简单的手势操作，还能监测心率、睡眠等健康数据。", "乐奇Rokid还表示，其平台注册开发者已超过4.5万名，应用商店上架智能体超过700个。合作方包括小红书、美团和京东。公司还宣布了全球开发者大赛，总奖金池500万元。", "不过，对许多消费者来说，这款眼镜仍然偏贵。最便宜的型号比中国大多数智能手机都贵，因此乐奇需要说服人们：戴一台电脑在脸上是值得的。"], "body": "Rokid Glasses 2 comes in black or tortoiseshell. The black model costs 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a government subsidy. The company says the glasses are smaller and lighter than the first version, and users can add custom lenses for short-sighted or long-sighted eyes.\n\nThe glasses have a 263mAh battery, which is 25% bigger than before. A new charging case can charge the glasses six times, and it also works with the first generation. The AI features include meeting notes, translation in 89 languages and help for deaf and blind users.\n\nRokid Color is a full-colour pair of glasses that weighs 55 grams. It can show pictures, videos and maps, so users can follow directions or check tasks without looking at a phone. Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan and supports simple finger movements, plus health tracking for heart rate and sleep.\n\nRokid also said its platform now has more than 45,000 registered developers and over 700 agents on its store. Partners include Xiaohongshu, Meituan and JD.com. The company announced a global developer contest with a 5 million yuan prize pool.\n\nHowever, the glasses are still expensive for many buyers. The cheapest model costs more than most smartphones in China, so Rokid must convince people that wearing a computer is worth the price.", "body_zh": "Rokid Glasses 2有黑色和玳瑁色两种配色。黑色款售价3699元，享受国补后为3199元。公司称这款眼镜比第一代更小更轻，用户还可以配近视或远视镜片。\n\n这款眼镜电池容量为263mAh，比上一代大25%。新的充电盒能给眼镜充六次电，也兼容第一代产品。AI功能包括会议纪要、89种语言翻译，以及为听障和视障用户提供的辅助功能。\n\nRokid Color是一副全彩眼镜，重55克。它能显示图片、视频和地图，用户不用看手机就能导航或查看任务。Rokid Ring售价1699元，支持简单的手势操作，还能监测心率、睡眠等健康数据。\n\n乐奇Rokid还表示，其平台注册开发者已超过4.5万名，应用商店上架智能体超过700个。合作方包括小红书、美团和京东。公司还宣布了全球开发者大赛，总奖金池500万元。\n\n不过，对许多消费者来说，这款眼镜仍然偏贵。最便宜的型号比中国大多数智能手机都贵，因此乐奇需要说服人们：戴一台电脑在脸上是值得的。", "text": "Rokid Glasses 2 comes in black or tortoiseshell. The black model costs 3,699 yuan, or 3,199 yuan with a government subsidy. The company says the glasses are smaller and lighter than the first version, and users can add custom lenses for short-sighted or long-sighted eyes. The glasses have a 263mAh battery, which is 25% bigger than before. A new charging case can charge the glasses six times, and it also works with the first generation. The AI features include meeting notes, translation in 89 languages and help for deaf and blind users. Rokid Color is a full-colour pair of glasses that weighs 55 grams. It can show pictures, videos and maps, so users can follow directions or check tasks without looking at a phone. Rokid Ring costs 1,699 yuan and supports simple finger movements, plus health tracking for heart rate and sleep. Rokid also said its platform now has more than 45,000 registered developers and over 700 agents on its store. Partners include Xiaohongshu, Meituan and JD.com. The company announced a global developer contest with a 5 million yuan prize pool. However, the glasses are still expensive for many buyers. The cheapest model costs more than most smartphones in China, so Rokid must convince people that wearing a computer is worth the price.", "vocab": [{"word": "wearable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可穿戴的", "note": "常作名词，指可穿戴设备", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "subsidy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "补贴", "note": "government subsidy 政府补贴", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lens", "pos": "noun", "zh": "镜片", "note": "复数 lenses", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电池", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "translation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "翻译", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发者", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "partner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合作伙伴", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "contest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "developer contest 开发者大赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "convince", "pos": "verb", "zh": "说服", "note": "convince sb that...", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "afford", "pos": "verb", "zh": "买得起", "note": "常与 can 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T00:40:07.973088", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Rokid", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.7, "sm": 325, "em": 699, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Glasses", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.237, "sm": 700, "em": 1237, "cs": 6, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "2", "s": 1.238, "e": 1.45, "sm": 1237, "em": 1449, "cs": 14, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "comes", "s": 1.45, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1450, "em": 1774, "cs": 16, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "in", "s": 1.775, "e": 1.925, "sm": 1775, "em": 1924, "cs": 22, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "black", "s": 1.925, "e": 2.35, "sm": 1925, "em": 2350, "cs": 25, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "or", "s": 2.35, "e": 2.475, "sm": 2350, "em": 2475, "cs": 31, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "tortoiseshell", "s": 2.475, "e": 3.55, "sm": 2475, "em": 3549, "cs": 34, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ".", "s": 3.55, "e": 3.675, "sm": 3550, "em": 3675, "cs": 47, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "The", "s": 3.675, "e": 3.775, "sm": 3675, "em": 3775, "cs": 49, "ce": 52, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": "black", "s": 3.775, "e": 4.075, "sm": 3775, "em": 4075, "cs": 53, "ce": 58, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "model", "s": 4.075, "e": 4.4